<title>UK: EIB adds 500 bln lire 15-year zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 500 bln lire 15-year zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 trillion lire from 1.0 trillion lire, lead manager IMI Luxembourg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT  ** 1.5 TRLN ITL COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    25.OCT.11</p>
<p> TYPE    ZERO-COUPON  ISS PRICE  31.20     PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  60 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 TRLN LIRE ON 25.SEP.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
